+        The experiment build of docs/design/face-detect-esp-dl-2026-11-17.md (patches FD01 to FD04). Pulls esp-dl 3.3.15 and the
+        human_face_detect 0.5.2 model package through the component manager (exact pins), puts the face models in the app image as
+        read-only data (about 190 KB for MSR plus MNP and 480 KB for ESPDet-Pico 224; no partition change), and adds a detector task
+        that loads a model only while it is asked to look, keeps the weights and activations in PSRAM and frees the model 10 seconds
+        after the last use. Needs the overlay sdkconfig.fdetect.defaults (it also turns on the model choices below). Off in every
+        shipped image: no component, no model, no task, no tool.
+
+if MAIPAI_FACE_DETECT
+
+choice MAIPAI_FACE_DETECT_MODEL
+    prompt "Face model the detector loads first"
+    default MAIPAI_FACE_DETECT_MODEL_MSRMNP
+    help
+        The model used when a caller does not name one. A bench tool call can ask for the other one at any time.
+
+    config MAIPAI_FACE_DETECT_MODEL_MSRMNP
+        bool "MSR plus MNP (two stages, about 191 KB, 120 by 160 input)"
+    config MAIPAI_FACE_DETECT_MODEL_PICO224
+        bool "ESPDet-Pico 224 (one stage, about 480 KB), run on a 160 by 120 crop"
+endchoice
+
+config MAIPAI_FACE_DETECT_DEFAULT_MODEL
